  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "155-root",
    "title": "AKU faculty appointed to senior positions at College of Physicians and Surgeons, Pakistan",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "AKU faculty from Departments of Pathology and Laboratory Medicine, and Family Medicine have been appointed at senior positions at CPSP.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "22ed6baafd7052f6",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "155-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/155-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "AKU faculty appointed to senior positions at College of Physicians and Surgeons, Pakistan"
      },
      {
        "_uid": "180307ea8c9c5918",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "medium",
        "filename": "155-MediumImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/155-MediumImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "AKU faculty appointed to senior positions at College of Physicians and Surgeons, Pakistan"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I am pleased to share with you that a number of our colleagues have been appointed at senior positions at College of Physicians and Surgeons Pakistan Faculties and Committees, including:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Shahid Pervez, Dean, Faculty of Histopathology, CPSP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Marie Andrades, Dean, Faculty of Family Medicine, CPSP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Naila Kayani, Member, Faculty of Histopathology, CPSP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Salman Naseem Adil, Member, Faculty of Haematology, CPSP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Imran Siddiqui, Member, Committee of Chemical Pathology, CPSP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Erum Khan, Focal Person, Committee on Microbiology, CPSP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Rumina Hasan, Member, Committee on Microbiology, CPSP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is indeed a great moment of pride and reflects their stature and standing in respective fields. I am confident that through the resourceful contributions of our faculty at CPSP, we will be able to make significant impact on postgraduate medical education nationally and will be able to steer and position CPSP to meet the emerging challenges of healthcare in the country."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Farhat Abbas"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dean, Medical College"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
